  {
    "id": "log-confession-p05260-713050d17cc9-context",
    "source": "<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>You're like a fish in a little pond. One of the <i>pretty</i> fish, that is.</indent>\n<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>But some day, you're going to realize you can get past the log at the other end of it.</indent>\n<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>And then you'll be free! Free to swim all the way to the sea!",
    "target": "<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>你就像小池塘里的一条鱼。我是说，那种<i>漂亮</i>的鱼。</indent>\n<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>但总有一天，你会发现，自己能越过池塘那头挡路的那截树干。</indent>\n<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>到时你就自由了！可以自由地一路游向大海！",
    "source_sha256": "3c22d237e0c107e42664df4ae15bbf12186b314df6a655a4cc12f499d5f3c1b4",
