  {
    "id": "log-confession-p05282-e3b4f04b277d-context",
    "source": "<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>I always thought that if I knew you better, maybe I'd be able to give you a kiss that would make you smile.</indent>\n<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>A-and now, well, here we are.</indent>\n<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>B-but if you don't want to, we'll still be friends, and I won't be mad!",
    "target": "<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>我总在想，要是我更了解你一些，也许就能给你一个吻，让你笑起来。</indent>\n<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>而、而现在，嗯……我们已经走到这一步了。</indent>\n<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>但、但如果你不愿意，我们还是朋友，我也不会生气的！",
